notes.content:
We’re thrilled to share the another update for the game! This time, we’re introducing [b]user-generated scenarios![/b]

[u][b]Gameplay[/b][/u]
[list]
[*] Added map generator options for Single player and Multi player;
[*] Added special beginning options to generated scenarios;
[*] Added City Hall local consumption behavior;
[*] An ending save file will be created after each chapter is completed in the campaign;[/list]
[u][b]Balancing[/b][/u]
[list]
[*] Grain and Cotton added to Geology resources and now can be discovered;
[*] Wood logging added to city lobbying in non-campaign scenarios;
[*] Consolidation locomotive rebalanced;
[*] Mastodon locomotive rebalanced;
[*] Warehouses of one player can now be used by other players in a multiplayer cooperative mode;
[*] Lobbyist level requirements for 'This or That' lobbying have been changed;[/list]
[u][b]UI[/b][/u]
[list]
[*] Notifications added to a Top panel when a research/lobbying/geology is completed;
[*] A Multiplayer saved session is now loaded from a main Load Game dialog;
[*] Cargo list scroll has been added to a Train panel;
[*] Auction panel improvements in a multiplayer versus mode;
[*] Discovered resources via geology are now visible to all players;
[*] Custom save, Autosave and Quick save naming refactored;
[*] Other UI improvements;[/list]
[u][b]Fixes[/b][/u]
[list]
[*] A special case when save file stuck loading at 72%;
[*] Objectives deadline is now synced properly in a multiplayer session;
[*] Building transaction fly-ups are now visible on a client;
[*] Locomotive broken on the way state is now synced properly in a multiplayer session;
[*] Locomotive animation was not working  properly in some cases;[/list]

 Localization improvements.

[b]Hey everyone, [/b]

As the Early Access phase of Railroad Corporation 2 is slowly chugging along, we’ll be steadily updating you about patches in these short blogs and [url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/1677970/discussions/0/4699035743124830016/][b]on our Steam Discussions thread. [/b][/url]

We’re thrilled to let you know that today, we’re bringing you some key fixes and improvements, directly addressing some of the areas you’ve highlighted since launch. Thanks to your detailed feedback, we’ve focused on resolving a few pesky issues, and making sure everything runs smoother for everyone. 

Here’s a full breakdown of our most recent patch notes:


Fixed an error that could cause a save files stopped loading at 72%;
Fixed an error caused wide screen resolution options missing in settings;
Fixed an error that did not allow create a trading rules in buildings created as a result of a geology discovery;
Fixed an error that caused a city population reset at a certain conditions;
Localization improvements.


This is just the beginning of our post-launch journey together, and we’re committed to keeping the momentum going. So please keep sharing your insights as we continue to make Railroad Corporation 2 the best experience it can be!

Corbie Games

